CAN
The main CAN bus that are used on the vehicle are classified on the basis of the baud rate.
The most used network are:
- C-CAN: the baud rate is 500 kb/s;
- B-CAN: the baud rate is 50 kb/s;
- BH-CAN: the baud rate is 125 kb/s;
- FD-CAN: the baud rate is variable up to 15Mb/s.
Usually on the C-CAN there are for sure all the ECUs that are emission relevant in accord to
EOBD normative.
Usually on the BH-CAN there are all the ECUs that manage multimedial information.
